#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/xdg-desktop-portal-gtk.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>xdg-desktop-portal-gtk</application> is a backend for "
"<application>xdg-desktop-portal</application>, that is using GTK and various"
" pieces of GNOME infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"<application>xdg-desktop-portal-gtk</application> é uma estrutura de "
"retaguarda para <application>xdg-desktop-portal</application>, que está "
"usando GTK e várias peças da infraestrutura do GNOME."

